WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.104
The Margulis Platonov conjecture.

2
00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:05.297
Normal subgroups should come only from compact

3
00:00:05.297 --> 00:00:07.894
places. A few exceptional types stayed open.

4
00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:12.500
A surprise subgroup would leave a finite quotient, which cannot exist here.

5
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:17.486
Claimed: every global field, characteristic two included.

6
00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:18.844
Not in Lean.
